This product includes data derived from the Moses decoder's non-breaking
prefix list for Portuguese (nonbreaking_prefix.pt), adapted for Portuguese by
H. Leal Fontes from the EN and DE lists published with moses-2009-04-13 (last
updated 2009-11-10), as redistributed by the NLTK project
(https://www.nltk.org/) under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The derived list lives in src/abbreviations.ts. Entries were kept as published;
none were added. Where the source lists a prefix in both of its classes, the
NUMERIC_ONLY class is applied, as the Moses loader's last-assignment-wins
semantics would. See that file's header for what the list does and does not
cover.
